<https://linked.data.gov.au/org/qld-daff>
    a schema:Organization ;
    schema:description """The Department of Agriculture and Fisheries (DAF) was officially dissolved and replaced by the Department of Primary Industries (DPI) on 1 November 2024, due to machinery of government changes.

Formerly known as the Department of Agriculture and Fisheries.

We ensure that Queensland’s primary industries—the essential backbone of our economy and communities—are productive, profitable and sustainable for future generations.

We do this by connecting industries, the community and government to grow our economy, protect our primary industries from biosecurity threats and support rural communities.""" ;
    schema:identifier "66 934 348 189"^^id:ausbn ;
    schema:name "Queensland Department of Agriculture and Fisheries" ;
